cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fused Maker (FusedAuto): a tool for summing and averaging repeated CT series"
abstract: >-
  Fused Maker (FusedAuto) sums or averages CT series acquired repeatedly at the same
  position, slice by slice, and saves the result as a new DICOM series. Series whose
  frame of reference, slice positions, matrix or slice count do not match are excluded
  automatically. For research and education use only; not for clinical use.
authors:
